	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Where... am I?”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"A comfortable floating sensation envelops my body.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Ahh, that's right. I sank into the river.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"...",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Huh? I can still breathe.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"How?",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Right...”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"I must have died.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Unable to avenge Mother, I sank to the depths of that river.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"It's all finally over now.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"When I realize that, all the pent-up exhaustion leaves my body.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Ahh, what a wonderful feeling...",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"A fond and familiar sight plays across the back of my eyelids.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"A remote villa deep in the mountains with a large persimmon tree.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Whether rain or snow or billowing winds─",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"There, I find myself swinging my wooden blade day after day.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Continuing my unrelenting training, that I might someday strike down Mother's killer.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"I'd never even held a blade before this.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"My hands are soon covered with blisters, and the searing pain causes me to lose strength in my grip.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Still, I don't rest my hands for even a second.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"I continue tirelessly swinging my blade, waiting for the time to come.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Whenever I drop my blade, I am harshly rebuked.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“Your Highness's resolve is weak!”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“Thinkest that to be enough to avenge Her Majesty!?”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“Your Highness is to reaffirm her duty as the Imperial Princess here and now!”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"I've always thought of Satonaka as more of a second mother than the Imperial Chamberlain.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Ever since I was young, she had hardened her heart to scold me for my childish folly.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"As luck would have it, Satonaka knows her way around a blade.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"Once I become skilled enough to receive her blessing, I will surely be able to strike Okonogi down.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(I won't run anymore.)”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(I'll overcome whatever harsh training she throws at me.)”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(And no matter how difficult the journey, I shall avenge Mother.)”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Satonaka and I vowed to each other to cast aside all common comforts until the day we avenged Mother's death.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"We keep our meals simple and our resting time to the bare minimum.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"I refrain from leaving the manor in order to dedicate every waking moment to my training and studies.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"Otherwise, I'll never be able to slay Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"He who, at this very moment, sits in the Imperial Palace, reigning over the Empire as its tyrant.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"After six months of living in Iseya, I receive a letter.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"It states that Okonogi has arrested every last person who once served in the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"The Satonakas have served the Imperial Family for hundreds of years.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"Among those arrested are not only Satonaka's spouse and children, but even their distant relatives.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm sorry, Satonaka! This is all because he stole our country out from under us!”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“Your Highness needn't concern herself with us.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“We have proudly served the Imperial Family for generations. We have been prepared for this eventuality ever since our defeat.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“Your Highness needs only to preoccupy herself with striking Okonogi down.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“Following that...”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“Your Highness ought demonstrate her splendid resolve, as to not sully the names of Emperors past.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"Since time immemorial, Emperors who fail to prevent disasters have given their lives to beg Oomikami's forgiveness.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"That is our pride and purpose as sovereigns of this land.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"I've had this creed drilled into me from the day I was born.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I shall not sully the name of the Imperial Family.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Satonaka, let us train even harder.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"From that day forward, I redouble my efforts in training.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"I cut down on my sleeping time and continue training until the dead of night.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Whenever she notices my heart begin to waver, Satonaka strikes me without mercy.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"It is unthinkable that a court lady should raise her hand against the Imperial Princess.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"But I welcome it.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Satonaka cannot hold back her tears as she beats me.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"My body quickly becomes covered in bruises.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"It hurts.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"It hurts so much I lose track of how many times I nearly break down in tears.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"Even so, I continue with my daily training.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"The one thing that brings me succor is the persimmon tree in the courtyard.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"The persimmons I eat during my short breaks between training have a deliciousness to them I've never tasted elsewhere.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"The sweetness that envelops my tongue serves to remind me that I'm still alive.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Another year passes, and I receive another letter.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"It states that all those arrested by Okonogi have returned to the darkness from whence they came.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Satonaka simply closes her eyes for a brief moment before regarding me with a kindly gaze containing not one hint of reproach.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“Your Highness, let us proceed with training.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"─Strike Okonogi down.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"─Then, atone for the mistakes of the Imperial Family.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"Satonaka's silence conveys those sentiments louder than any words.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"Training.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"Ever harsher training.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"That is all I am able to do.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"That I might avenge Mother.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"That I might redeem the sacrifices of the fallen.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"For all this, I must become stronger.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"─I don't remember if the persimmon trees bore fruit that autumn.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Those persimmons look most delicious.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"A bright voice rings out from nowhere.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“They have already ripened. Are you not going to eat them?”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"I look up to find the branches sagging with ripe fruits.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"I couldn't form the words.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"All the days of intense training have dispossessed my body of the superfluous skill of speech.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll pass. You can have them.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"When I finally squeeze out the words, the girl wipes a persimmon with the edge of her sleeve and begins happily munching on it.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Seeing her innocent smile, my spirits brighten for some strange reason.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The earth's bounty is a blessing from Oomikami.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is hardly forgivable to leave them to wither on the vine.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Then take as many as you want.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Really?!”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, I mean... I suppose only if I must... I'll be back!”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"The girl bobs her head at me and gaily skips away.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Watching her profile recede into the distance, I tighten my grip on my blade.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"It somehow feels lighter all of a sudden.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Perhaps the sweetness that the girl tasted energized my own body as well.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"True to her word, the girl comes again the next day, and the day after that.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"It seems she's taken quite a liking to the persimmons.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama, persimmons make for much better snacks than training dummies.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No need for that.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Are you not fond of them? They taste so wonderful and all...”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"The girl's face is as charmingly plump as the persimmons she eats day in and day out.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"And as thanks for them, she heals my injuries with her magicks.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"My hands with calluses thick as gloves and my battered and bruised body all return to being as unblemished as the day I was born.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama, I come bearing a paring knife today!”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You do not enjoy eating the skin as I do, is that so?”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If a whole fruit is too much, please at least partake of a single bite or two.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"The girl peels a persimmon and insistently offers it to me.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Look at this! It's so ripe that the skewer goes right through it. I'm sure it will be delicious.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, ahhh?!”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"The persimmon tumbles out of the overeager girl's hand.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"I catch it and slowly bring it to my mouth.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Very ripe.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Indeed, is it not?”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"The girl smiles radiantly from ear to ear.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"The sight of it warms my heart much more than the fruit abates my hunger.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"But at the same time, it only serves to remind me of my guilt.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"Her presence is a balm for my weary body and spirit.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"That which I am entirely unworthy of, not while Mother's killer still draws breath.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"I'm sure that Satonaka would feel the same way.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Recently, Satonaka has been bedridden with sickness.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"She has trouble even getting up, yet she obstinately refuses to let me take care of her.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"She says that if I have the time to attend to her, I have the time to be training harder.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I want this to be the last time you come around here.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh? Whyever might that be?”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"I say nothing and return to my training.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"─Strike Okonogi down.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"─Then, atone for the mistakes of the Imperial Family.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"My interminable days of training continue once again.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"This is for the best.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"I have no need of an ordinary life.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"With nobody to eat them anymore, the persimmons eventually fall to the ground.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"White snow eventually buries the ground stained with overripe persimmons.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"As the temperature descends, Satonaka's end draws near.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"The day after a heavy snowstorm, she beckons me to her bedside.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“I have been watching Your Highness every day from here, and I believe Your Highness now possesses the strength for the task at hand.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"Perhaps she senses her impending death, as Satonaka's words are unusually kind today.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Satonaka, I still have so much to learn from you...”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“My affliction-ridden state is now little more than a hindrance to Your Highness.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"Satonaka smiles peacefully up at me.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“The Master of the Myougikan, Inou Kokuan-sama, once said the following.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“One who has killed and one who has not. When the fatal moment comes, a world of difference separates the two.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“'Tis a vast chasm that cannot be spanned by means of mere training.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"Sensing her intentions, my hand begins to tremble.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“If Your Highness trembles so when the time comes, that lack of resolve might stay Your Highness's hand.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“Your Highness's humble servant would be honored to perform one final service.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't be ridiculous!”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You just have a cold... You'll be right as rain with a little more rest...”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“Your Highness.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"Satonaka turns to face me, her eyes cloudy with sickness.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I can't, Satonaka!”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“Please, be brave.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“There could be no greater honor than to offer my life to Your Highness.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"Her gentle smile threatens to suffocate me.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"For the past three years, Satonaka has always ruthlessly loomed over me as an iron-fisted overlord.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"She treated me so strictly that I thought many times of killing her.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"And so, why?",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"Why, in her final moments, must she look at me like this?",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“Your Highness, the meaning will be lost if I expire first.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“Before my life burns out... Make haste...”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Satonaka!”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
